{"seq":2,"slug":"lexical-hybrid","title":"词法与混合检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/retrieval/lexical-hybrid","wordCount":1280,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"词法与混合检索\">词法与混合检索</h1><p>上一篇承认了语义检索在精确符号上的天花板，这一篇请回它的搭档。一个 1990 年代就成熟的算法 BM25，在 2026 年的代码检索里依然是不可或缺的一路——因为代码靠精确符号说话，<code>getUserById</code> 这个名字本身就是世上最好的查询信号。这篇讲词法检索为什么在代码上格外好使，以及怎样用融合把它和语义检索拧成混合检索，取两者之长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>词法检索（lexical / sparse retrieval）匹配的是字面词项，不理解语义。它的代表是 BM25，建立在 <a href=\"../indexing/index-structures\">索引结构</a> 里的倒排索引之上：把每个块拆成词项、建立「词项到块」的倒排表，查询时按词项命中并打分。前面已经给出过 BM25 的打分公式与它偏爱罕见词的原理（见 <a href=\"../foundations/code-vs-text-retrieval\">代码检索的特殊性</a>），这里不重复推导，只强调结论：代码里信息量最大的恰是罕见标识符，而 BM25 天然偏爱它们。</p>\n<p>把两路检索的能力对照成一张表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>词法（BM25）</th>\n<th>语义（向量）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确符号名</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然语言意图</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>罕见标识符</td>\n<td>强（高 IDF）</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同义/近义概念</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引/查询成本</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>高（看得到命中词）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表是整个混合检索的动机：两列的强弱几乎处处相反，合起来才能覆盖代码检索的全部查询形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码专属的词法处理\">代码专属的词法处理</h2><p>把 BM25 照搬到代码上还不够，要做几处代码专属的适配，否则词法检索会漏掉很多本该命中的东西。</p>\n<p>第一是<strong>标识符切分</strong>。<code>getUserById</code> 是一个词还是 <code>get</code>/<code>User</code>/<code>By</code>/<code>Id</code> 四个词？两种切法都要保留——既索引整词（精确命中），又按驼峰/下划线拆分子词（命中部分查询）。第二是<strong>保留符号语义</strong>。<code>-&gt;</code>、<code>::</code>、<code>&lt;T&gt;</code> 这类在散文里会被当标点丢掉的符号，在代码里有意义，分词器不能简单剥掉。第三是<strong>结合符号索引</strong>。除了纯文本 BM25，很多系统还建一层符号索引（函数名、类名、定义位置到引用位置的映射），支持「跳转定义、查找引用」式的精确导航——这正是 agentic search 顺藤摸瓜的底层能力（见 <a href=\"../foundations/why-code-retrieval\">为什么需要代码检索</a>）。</p>\n<p>标识符切分最直观的例子就是「整词与子词双索引」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import re&#10;&#10;ident = &quot;getUserById&quot;&#10;subwords = re.findall(r&quot;[A-Z]?[a-z]+|[A-Z]+(?![a-z])&quot;, ident)&#10;terms = {ident.lower(), *(w.lower() for w in subwords)}&#10;# -&gt; {&#39;getuserbyid&#39;, &#39;get&#39;, &#39;user&#39;, &#39;by&#39;, &#39;id&#39;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> re</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ident </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"getUserById\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">subwords </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> re.findall(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[A-Z]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[a-z]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[A-Z]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+(?!</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[a-z]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ident)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">terms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {ident.lower(), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w.lower() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subwords)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># -> {'getuserbyid', 'get', 'user', 'by', 'id'}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>查询 <code>getUserById</code> 命中整词，查询 <code>user id</code> 或 <code>User</code> 命中子词——同一份倒排表同时服务两种问法，这正是词法检索在代码上「能打」的细节来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合检索-rrf-把两路拼起来\">混合检索：RRF 把两路拼起来</h2><p>有了词法和语义两路候选，怎么合成一个排名？直接把两边的分数加权相加行不通——BM25 的分数和余弦相似度量纲不同、分布不同，硬加会被某一边主导。2026 年的标准答案是<strong>倒数排名融合（RRF）</strong>，它只看排名不看分数，绕开了量纲不兼容的问题（<a href=\"https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/hybrid-search-bm25-vector-reranking-reference-2026\">digitalapplied</a>、<a href=\"https://glaforge.dev/posts/2026/02/10/advanced-rag-understanding-reciprocal-rank-fusion-in-hybrid-search/\">glaforge</a>）。</p>\n<p>对一个块 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，设它在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 路检索中的排名为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，RRF 的融合分为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RRF</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>rrf</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RRF}(d) = \\sum_{i} \\frac{1}{k_{\\text{rrf}} + r_i(d)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RRF</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5991em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rrf</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>rrf</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_{\\text{rrf}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rrf</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是平滑常数（常取 60）。排名越靠前贡献越大，且因为是排名的倒数，两路的尺度被自然归一。一个块若在词法和语义两路都排前列，融合分会显著高于只在一路靠前的块——这正是「两路都认可的更可信」这一直觉的数学表达。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[查询] --&gt; B[词法 BM25 检索]&#10;    A --&gt; C[语义向量检索]&#10;    B --&gt; D[词法排名列表]&#10;    C --&gt; E[语义排名列表]&#10;    D --&gt; F[RRF 按排名融合]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[融合候选 top-N]&#10;    G --&gt; H[交给重排精修]\">flowchart TD\n    A[查询] --&gt; B[词法 BM25 检索]\n    A --&gt; C[语义向量检索]\n    B --&gt; D[词法排名列表]\n    C --&gt; E[语义排名列表]\n    D --&gt; F[RRF 按排名融合]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[融合候选 top-N]\n    G --&gt; H[交给重排精修]</pre><p>研究与生产经验一致表明：BM25 与稠密向量经 RRF 融合后的 nDCG 普遍高于任何单路（<a href=\"https://ashutoshkumars1ngh.medium.com/hybrid-search-done-right-fixing-rag-retrieval-failures-using-bm25-hnsw-reciprocal-rank-fusion-a73596652d22\">ashutosh medium</a>、<a href=\"https://appscale.blog/en/blog/hybrid-search-and-reranking-production-rag-bm25-dense-cross-encoder-2026\">appscale</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合不是终点-还要重排\">混合不是终点：还要重排</h2><p>要纠正一个常见误解：RRF 融合出的列表已经不错，但它依然是「粗排」。RRF 只是把两路排名机械合并，并没有真正逐对精算 query 与每个候选的相关度。融合后的 top-N（如 50）里仍混有噪声，直接全塞给模型会浪费窗口预算（见 <a href=\"../foundations/retrieval-vs-context\">检索与上下文窗口</a>）。</p>\n<p>所以生产管线的标准形态是：<strong>词法 + 语义候选生成 → RRF 融合 → cross-encoder 重排 → 喂模型</strong>（<a href=\"https://optyxstack.com/rag-reliability/hybrid-search-reranking-playbook\">optyxstack</a>）。混合检索负责「保召回」，重排负责「提精度」，二者分工明确。重排怎么做，是下一篇的主题（见 <a href=\"reranking-filtering\">重排与过滤</a>）。这条管线如何作为整体落到代码库上，则在 <a href=\"../practice/rag-over-codebase\">代码库 RAG</a> 收口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>词法检索（BM25）匹配字面词项，因代码靠精确符号说话、罕见标识符高 IDF，在代码上格外强。</li>\n<li>需做代码专属适配：整词+子词双索引、保留 <code>-&gt;</code>/<code>::</code> 等符号、加一层符号索引支持跳转/查引用。</li>\n<li>词法与语义强弱几乎处处相反，合用才覆盖全部查询形态，这是混合检索的动机。</li>\n<li>RRF 只看排名不看分数，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>rrf</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum 1/(k_{\\text{rrf}} + r_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rrf</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 绕开量纲不兼容，融合 nDCG 普遍高于单路。</li>\n<li>RRF 融合仍是粗排，标准管线为「双路候选 → RRF → cross-encoder 重排 → 喂模型」，重排见 <a href=\"reranking-filtering\">重排与过滤</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"词法与混合检索","id":"词法与混合检索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"代码专属的词法处理","id":"代码专属的词法处理"},{"level":2,"text":"混合检索：RRF 把两路拼起来","id":"混合检索-rrf-把两路拼起来"},{"level":2,"text":"混合不是终点：还要重排","id":"混合不是终点-还要重排"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"语义检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/retrieval/semantic-search"},"next":{"title":"重排与过滤","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/retrieval/reranking-filtering"}}